{"session":"pr_pydantic__pydantic-ai__10038","actor":"agent","kind":"agent_message","timestamp":"2026-10-09T14:41:21Z","content":"Enable prompt caching with `Caching()` in the example apps\n\nPrompt caching is opt-in until v3, but it's what users should reach for by default, so the example apps now model it: every agent in `examples/pydantic_ai_examples/` that makes regular model requests gets `capabilities=[Caching()]` (the capability from #7560).\n\nSkipped on purpose: agents that only drive a realtime session (`realtime_voice.py`, `realtime_text_to_audio.py`, `realtime_webrtc/app.py`, the voice agent in `realtime_handoff.py`, the camera assistant in `realtime_camera/app.py`), since the `cache` model setting doesn't apply to realtime models. The regular agents in those files (the handoff triage agent, the camera's diagram drawer) do get it.\n\nThe docs pages under `docs/examples/` include these files via `snippet`, so they pick the change up without edits. The `Caching` docs, `docs/agent.md` and the agent skill are handled separately.\n\n- Follow-up to #7560\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [x] No **breaking changes** in accordance with the [version policy](https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/blob/main/docs/version-policy.md).\n- [x] Any permitted **compatibility impact** has a label, warning, migration, release note, and exact API-check waiver.\n- [x] **PR title** is fit for the [release changelog](https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a href=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/pydantic/pydantic-ai/pull/10038?utm_source=github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img alt=\"View guided diff\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","refs":["examples/pydantic_ai_examples/ag_ui/api/agentic_chat.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/ag_ui/api/agentic_generative_ui.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/ag_ui/api/human_in_the_loop.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/ag_ui/api/predictive_state_updates.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/ag_ui/api/shared_state.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/ag_ui/api/tool_approval.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/ag_ui/api/tool_based_generative_ui.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/bank_support.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/cancel_and_resume.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/chat_app.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/data_analyst.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/evals/agent.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/flight_booking.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/medical_agent_delegation.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/pydantic_model.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/rag.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/realtime_camera/app.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/realtime_handoff.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/roulette_wheel.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/slack_lead_qualifier/agent.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/sql_gen.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/stream_markdown.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/stream_whales.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/twelvelabs_video_agent.py","examples/pydantic_ai_examples/weather_agent.py"],"meta":{"agent":"claude-code","login":"DouweM"}}
